       interests therein unchanged; or (b) receiving cash in an amount equal to
       the Member's pro-rata share of the appraised Net Asset Value of the
       Company.

13.3 Limitations on Roll-Ups. The Company's ability to participate in a Roll-Up
is also subject to the following:

       13.3.1 The Company shall not participate in any proposed Roll-Up which
       would result in Members having voting rights in the Roll-Up Entity which
       are less than those provided in Section 6.2 of this Agreement.

       13.3.2 If the Roll-Up Entity is a corporation, the voting rights of the
       Members shall correspond to the voting rights provided in this Agreement
       to the extent reasonably possible.

