       includes provisions which would operate to materially impede or frustrate
       the accumulation of shares, units or other equity interests, however
       denominated, by any purchaser of the securities of the Roll-Up Entity
       (except to the minimum necessary to preserve the tax status of the
       Roll-Up Entity).

       13.3.4 The Company will not participate in any proposed Roll-Up which
       would limit the ability of a Member to exercise the voting rights of the
       securities of the Roll-Up Entity on the basis of the value of the
